<h2>Five checks before paying</h2><ol>
<li>Confirm the exact car and requested diagnostic or coding task with the official developer's compatibility listing.</li>
<li>Verify the operator host OS and approved physical adapter, including firmware/model suffix if available.</li>
<li>Select the actual product entitlement, not a similarly named app or advertised bundled package.</li>
<li>Record local checkout total, currency, fees, recurring terms and the hardware inclusion statement.</li>
<li>Keep a dated first-party receipt or source record and understand the safety boundary of the requested operation.</li>
